---
/**
 * The exercises at the end of a chapter. Put <Exercise> blocks inside.
 * Aim for three to five: one by hand, one with a figure, one in code.
 */
---

<section class="exercises my-20" style="counter-reset: exercise">
  <h2 class="plain" id="exercises">Exercises <span id="exercise-tally" class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-normal tracking-widest text-orange-700"></span></h2>
  <p class="!mb-8 text-base text-stone-500 italic">
    Try each one before opening its solution. Getting stuck for a few minutes is where most of the learning happens.
  </p>
  <slot />
</section>
